  }
  Spacer(Modifier.height(12.dp))
}
```
Currently spacer after each Button. Adjust.

Need avoid lambda call recomposition issue, fine.

Use MediaPlayer on main thread; prepareAsync. Add `setOnCompletionListener { it.release(); if (player === it) player = null }` but comparing. Simpler release on next play/dispose. Fine.

